{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a neon mech arena brawl!</strong><br>This is a fast-paced 2D top-down action game where you pilot a combat mech and fight off waves of hostile robots. Every battle is a test of survival, reflexes, and smart upgrade choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game blends elements of <i>arena shooter</i>, <i>roguelike</i>, and <i>survivor-style</i> gameplay, inspired by hits like <strong>Vampire Survivors</strong> and <strong>Hotline Miami</strong>. Each run is unique \u2014 collect upgrades, build your mech, and fight through the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade your mech</strong>: choose powerful enhancements after each wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Face enemy hordes</strong>: from light drones to heavy war machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Intense action</strong>: fast, brutal, and unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Pixel art visuals</strong>: stylish retro graphics with a neon twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple controls</strong>: easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the quickest will survive. Can you make it to the end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751810?t=1749666615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751810?t=1749666615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751810/c6137996c5263cbff6510eeee33ce25676231ff7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749666615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751810/c6137996c5263cbff6510eeee33ce25676231ff7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749666615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed